</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4 Experiments and Results ‣ Small Open Models Achieve Near-Parity with Large Models in Low-Resource Literary Translation at a Fraction of the Cost" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Model Comparison and Discussion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4 Experiments and Results ‣ Small Open Models Achieve Near-Parity with Large Models in Low-Resource Literary Translation at a Fraction of the Cost" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span>Cost Analysis</span></a>
