<td id="Ax1.T7.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right">Flat monthly + per-character rate, converted to tokens</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T7.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T7.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">TF2 models (ours)</th>
<td id="Ax1.T7.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">–</td>
