<td id="Ax1.T7.2.7.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_bb">Rented GPUs (<math id="Ax1.T7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx 340" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≈</mo><mn>340</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx 340</annotation></semantics></math>$ for 3M fables)</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Per-million-token pricing assumptions used in cost calculations.</figcaption>
