</section>
<section id="Ax1.SSx2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.2 Hardware Configurations for TF2 Models</h3>

<div id="Ax1.SSx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#Ax1.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ A.2 Hardware Configurations for TF2 Models ‣ Appendix A. Cost Calculation and Hardware Configurations ‣ Small Open Models Achieve Near-Parity with Large Models in Low-Resource Literary Translation at a Fraction of the Cost" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> lists the compute environments used for training and inference.
We relied exclusively on commodity GPUs (cloud or local) with support for FP16/bfloat16 mixed precision
and 8-bit quantization (W8A8). All inference experiments were executed via the <span id="Ax1.SSx2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">OpenRouter</span> API,
which provided unified access to both open-weight and proprietary models.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Ax1.T8" class="ltx_table">
<table id="Ax1.T8.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Stage</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Hardware</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Runtime</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">Notes</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">Fine-tuning TF2-1B</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t">1 <math id="Ax1.T8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> l40s</th>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">1h</td>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t">LoRA adapters, FP16</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Fine-tuning TF2-4B</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">1 <math id="Ax1.T8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> l40s</th>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2-3h</td>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Gradient accumulation, FP16</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Fine-tuning TF2-12B</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">1 <math id="Ax1.T8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> h100</th>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2h</td>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">FP16, early stopping</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">Inference (3M fables)</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">8 <math id="Ax1.T8.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\times" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>×</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\times</annotation></semantics></math> h100</th>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left"><math id="Ax1.T8.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sim" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∼</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sim</annotation></semantics></math>31h</td>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">sfcompute clusters, vLLM endpoints</td></tr>
<tr id="Ax1.T8.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">Quantization</th>
<th id="Ax1.T8.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_bb">CPU + GPU mix</th>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><math id="Ax1.T8.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&lt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;</annotation></semantics></math>1h per model</td>
<td id="Ax1.T8.2.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">W8A8 compression with <span id="Ax1.T8.2.6.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">llmcompressor</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 8: </span>Hardware setups for training and inference. Runtime values are approximate wall-clock time.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SSx3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.3 Energy and Cost of Local Compute</h3>

<div id="Ax1.SSx3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To approximate the cost of our TF2 pipeline, we base calculations on the provider we used (<span id="Ax1.SSx3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">sfcompute</span>):</p>
<ul id="Ax1.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">GPU rental:</span> $1.35 per GPU-hour; our 8-GPU node is billed at $10.80 per <em id="Ax1.I1.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">cluster</em>-hour.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Electricity:</span> Not applicable (cloud rental includes energy). For on-prem scenarios only, a rough estimate is 300–450 W/GPU at $0.14/kWh (<math id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\approx\$0.04" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo rspace="0.1389em">≈</mo><mrow><mo lspace="0.1389em" rspace="0.167em">$</mo><mn>0.04</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\approx\$0.04</annotation></semantics></math>–<math id="Ax1.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\$0.06" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">$</mo><mn>0.06</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\$0.06</annotation></semantics></math> per GPU-hour).</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SSx3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The resulting rental cost is</p>
<table id="Ax1.Ex2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="Ax1.Ex2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{\text{rental}}~[\$]\;=\;10.8\times H_{\text{cluster}}," display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>rental</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0.330em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">$</mo><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn> 10.8</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{\text{rental}}~[\$]\;=\;10.8\times H_{\text{cluster}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="Ax1.SSx3.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where <math id="Ax1.SSx3.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\text{cluster}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>cluster</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\text{cluster}}</annotation></semantics></math> is the logged wall-clock cluster time (hours). For reference, 24, 32, and 40 cluster-hours correspond to $259.2, $345.6, and $432, respectively. Storage and network costs were negligible in our runs.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="Ax1.SSx4" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection">A.4 Software Environment</h3>

<div id="Ax1.SSx4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Experiments were conducted in the following software stack:</p>
<ul id="Ax1.I2" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Ax1.I2.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I2.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">OS:</span> Manjaro + Linux 6.12</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I2.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Frameworks:</span> PyTorch 2.7.1, Hugging Face Transformers 4.54.0, PEFT 0.11</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I2.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Inference:</span> vLLM 0.7.3, FlashAttention</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I2.i4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Quantization:</span> <span id="Ax1.I2.i4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">llmcompressor</span> (Aug 2024 release)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="Ax1.I2.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="Ax1.I2.i5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Ax1.I2.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax1.I2.i5.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Deployment artifacts:</span> GGUF and Safetensors formats</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="Ax1.SSx4.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax1.SSx4.p2.1" class="ltx_p">This environment ensures reproducibility and efficient deployment across both local and cloud hardware.</p>
</div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="Ax2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix">Appendix B. Qualitative Translation Examples (Five Cases)</h2>

<div id="Ax2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="Ax2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present five representative problem cases. For each, we show excerpts from the <em id="Ax2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Original (EN)</em>, the <em id="Ax2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Gemma-3-12B (untuned)</em> output, and the <em id="Ax2.p1.1.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">TF2-12B (fine-tuned)</em> output. We highlight the key segments where fine-tuning clearly improves lexical choice, species fidelity, and idiomatic Romanian.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Ax2.T9" class="ltx_table">
<table id="Ax2.T9.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="Ax2.T9.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Original (EN)</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="Ax2.T9.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Gemma-3-12B (untuned)</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="Ax2.T9.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">TF2-12B (fine-tuned)</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“A <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Greedy Skunk</span> loved to explore the temple, sniffing out shiny trinkets… As it gazed into the mirror, it saw a <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">kind-hearted Skunk</span> staring back. ‘I’m special because I’m the <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">best treasure hunter</span>!’”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„Un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Fumeg de lăcomie</span> adora să exploreze templul… un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Fumeg frumos 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i cu inimă bună</span> îl privea… ‘Sunt special pentru că sunt cel mai bun <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">căutător de comori</span>!’”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sconcsul Lacom</span> iubea să exploreze templul… un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sconcs frumos 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i bun la suflet</span> îl privea… ‘Sunt special pentru că sunt cel mai bun <span id="Ax2.T9.2.2.3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">vânător de comori</span>!’”</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“In a sleepy village… a kind and gentle <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">cheetah</span> lived. When a hungry lion appeared, she shared food and comforted him. Together with her friends, they decided to <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">plant a strong tree</span> to symbolize their friendship… helping others earns <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">lasting loyalty</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„…trăia o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ceată blândă 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i bună</span>. Când un leu flămând a apărut, ceata i-a împăr
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>it mâncare… au decis să planteze un copac puternic… ajutorul oferit altora aduce o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">loialitate de durată</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„…trăia o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">ghepardă blândă 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i bună</span>. Când un leu flămând a apărut, gheparda 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i-a împăr
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>it hrana… Au hotărât să planteze un copac puternic, <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">simbol al noii prietenii</span>… a-i ajuta pe ceilal
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i aduce <span id="Ax2.T9.2.3.3.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">loialitate de durată</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">The Hippopotamus’ Hidden Treasure</span>… She met a wise tortoise by the river, who told her, ‘<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sharing is caring</span>.’ With her friends’ help, she found the imposter and learned that wise counsel can <span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">light the way</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Iepura
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>ul 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i Comoara Ascunsă</span>… a întâlnit pe <span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">un 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>estoasă</span> bătrân… ‘<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ampărtă
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>irea este dragoste</span>.’… a învă
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>at că sfatul în
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>elept poate <span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.2.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">lumina drumul</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comoara ascunsă a hipopotamului</span>… a întâlnit o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">broască 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.2.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>estoasă</span> bătrână… ‘<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">A împăr
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i înseamnă a-
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.3.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>i păsa</span>.’… a învă
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>at că sfatul în
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>elept poate <span id="Ax2.T9.2.4.3.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">lumina calea</span>.”</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“In a sun-kissed flower field, a clever <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">skunk</span> named Stinky fell in love with a <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">butterfly</span>, Pretty. But her best friend, a grumpy old <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">owl</span>, disliked him. When they saw their <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">reflections</span> in the stream, they realized, ‘We’ve been judging each other wrong.’”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„Într-o luncă plină de flori, un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">pui de prepeli
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>ă</span> 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>iret… s-a îndrăgostit de o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">libelulă</span>… prietena ei, un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bufni
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.4.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>el</span> morocănos… au văzut reflexiile în <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">apa limpezi</span>… ‘Ne-am judecat gre
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>s</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.2.1.1.1.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>it,’ spuse Miron.”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„Într-un câmp de flori scăldat de soare, un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">sconcs</span> iste
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
