<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.8.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.8.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.5.3.1.1.1.8.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>it,’ spuse Stinky.”</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="Ax2.T9.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:103.5pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“In a forgotten shipyard, a greedy <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">puma</span> lived. As a storm flooded the docks, a wise old <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">owl</span> offered help. Together they escaped and he learned: ‘That’s the power of <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">teamwork</span>.’”</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.9pt;">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">„Într-<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">o 
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
