<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.1.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>antier naval</span> uitată, trăia un <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">pumnă malign</span>… o <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bufni
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_top">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span>t</span></span>
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_l ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left"><span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.3.1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-1.3pt;">,</span></span></span>
</span>a zâmbi</span>: ‘Aceasta este puterea <span id="Ax2.T9.2.6.2.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">muncii în echipă</span>.’”</span></span>
</span></td>
